    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2018'04'09Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 09.04.20181A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2134$31 - 2019 cQ,s ui 30 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'07'30No. 2134/31 - TUESDAY, JULY 30, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE PUTHUKKUDIYIRUPPUPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Puthukkudiyiruppu Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason ofResignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Leader of the Independent Group, to which Anton Radnaraja Lavanja the member belonged,was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon returned member if IndependentGroup who belongs to such Independent Group, and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the local authorities ElectionsOrdinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Leader of the aforesaid Independent Group has communicated his decision to nominateSelvarani Arulanantham to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Kanthirasa Kantheepan, Returning Officer of the Puthukkudiyiruppu Pradeshiya Sabha,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatSelvarani Arulanantham was selected as the member of the Puthukkudiyiruppu Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nK. KANTHEEPAN,Returning Officer,Puthukkudiyiruppu Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nDistrict Election Office,Mullaitivu,29th July 2019.\n\n08 - 538\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 30639 \u2014 27 (07/2019)\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
