    "chunk_text": "SANJEEWANI KANDAMBI, Divisional Secretary, Kalawana.\n\nAt Divisional Secretariat of Kalawana, 24th July, 2019.\n\n08 - 584\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 30645 - 57 (2019/07)\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.07.31 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 31.07.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy No.: Dehi/2-1/Ath/749. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose:\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired : Allotments of the lands in total Extent about 0.0654 Hectares depicted in Preliminary Plan No. Co. 9821, prepared by Survey General, situated in the village of Nugegoda, within Municipal Council Limits of Dehiwala - Mount Lavinia in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Dehiwala in Colombo District in Western Province.\n\n1. P.P. No. Co. 9821 Lot No. 01 Name of the land: Alubogahawatta, Asst. No. 147, High Level Road; Description : Garden, Contains 02 Permanent Buildings; Claimant: State; Original Claimant : Not be found; Extent: 0.0654 Hectare."
