    "md5": "46c41f88be490b7f74683f5ea7f4a3db",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1269,
    "chunk_text": "3.The admission to Botanic Gardens Regulation published to Gazette Extraordinary No.1685/17 of 22.12.2010and amended by the GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY No.1700/10 of 06.04.2011 & by the Gazette Extraordinary No.1969 of\n\nSchedule\n\n01.Persons ( for one person)\n\n(A) Sri Lankans:-\n\n1. Adults and children over twelve (12) years of AgeRs.100.002. Children below twelve (12) years of Age and school childrenRs. 20.003. Adults over the age of sixty (60) on producing National Identity CardRs. 20.00\n\n(B) Foreigners :-\n\n1. Adults and children over twelve (12) years of AgeRs. 2,000.002. Children below twelve (12) years of AgeRs. 1,000.003. School Children & University students ( Upon producing of Satisfactoryproof of the same to the curator of the Botanic Gardens)Rs.1,200.00\n\n02.Vehicles ( each vehicle)\n\n1. Cars, Jeeps ,Station Wagons and Three wheelersRs. 250.002. Motor Bicycles and Motor ScootersRs. 100.003. Foot Cycles Rs. 50.00\n\n03.For ride boats at the boat yards of Gampaha (Henerathgoda) Botanic Gardens andSeethawaka Wet Zone Botanic Gardens\n\nLimited to half an hour for two personsRs. 300.00\n\n04.Charges for Battery cars\n\n1. 08 Seater Battery carRs. 2,000.002. 03 Seater Battery carRs. 1,000.00\n\n08 - 612\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
