    "chunk_text": "1. Obtain an application form or agreement seeking a corporate subscriber SIM Card to a new telephone corporateaccount, under a corporate package duly signed by an authorized officer of the corporate subscriber.\n\n2. The application referred to in paragraph 1 shall accompany the following :-\n\n(a) a true copy of the certificate of Business Registration ;\n\n3. Business Registration Number of the corporate subscriber shall be entered in the operator\u2019s database or networkprior to the activation of the corporate subscriber SIM Cards.\n\n4. Scanned copies of the documents listed in paragraphs 1, 2 and 3 shall be uploaded on the operator\u2019s database ornetwork within one month of the SIM Card activation as and when required by an authorized officer.\n\n5. Where a corporate subscriber using a SIM Card leaves the registered business entity, the connection under thecorporate package shall be disconnected.\n\n6. Details of a corporate subscriber under corporate package shall be updated in accordance with paragraph 4 fromtime to time and submit such details as and when required by an authorized officer.\n\n7. Every operator is required to provide access to the database or network as and when required by TRCSL toobtain information and data of a subscriber.\n\n8. Every operator is required to disconnect the telephone connection if the instructions set out in paragraph 4 arenot followed within one month from the date of SIM Card activation.\n\n08 - 655\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
