:\n\n01. Lot \u2018\u2018A\u2019\u2019 \u2013 Millagahadeniya, Millagahakumbura \u2013 Extent:\n\n0.1161 Hectare\n\nNorth: Road and Rubber estate Road; East: Rubber estate Road;"
