    "chunk_text": "RAVINDRA SAMARAWEERA,Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nColombo,24th July, 2019.\n\n08 - 728/1\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G30672 \u2013 21 (2019/08)\n\nMy No.: IR/22/05/2013.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS AN Industrial Dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner of Labour which accompaniesthis order exists between \u2013\n\nMr. M. A. Ranasinghe, Padiwatte, Kundasale, Nattarampotha of the one part\n\nand\n\nSri Lankan Airlines Limited, Airline Centre, Bandaranaike International Airport, Katunayaka. of the other part\n\nNOW THEREFORE I, Ravindra Samaraweera, Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations do by virtue of the powers vested in me bySection 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amended byActs, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes - Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appointMr. R. S. Ariyapperuma, No. 03, Araliya Mawatha, Sirimal Uyana, Ratmalana to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him forsettlement by arbitration.\n\nRAVINDRA SAMARAWEERA,Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nColombo,24th July, 2019.\n\nMy No.: IR/22/05/2013.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nMr. M. A. Ranasinghe, Padiwatte, Kundasale, Nattarampotha of the one part\n\nand\n\nSri Lankan Airlines Limited, Airline Centre, Bandaranaike International Airport, Katunayaka. of the other part\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013"
