    "chunk_text": "1. Mr. M.A. Saman Wenura Nishantha, No. 409/8 A, Kottunna Road, Janamahima Place, Biyagama.\n\n2. Mr. P.P.D.N. Karunarathna, No. 458/1, -C, Mankada Road, Lower Biyanwila, Kadawatha. of the one part\n\nand\n\nCeylon Petroleum Storage Terminals Limited, Nimawa, Kolonnawa of the other part .\n\nI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'08'05PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.08.20193A\n\nMr. P. Nawaratne, No. 570/B/1, Ekamuthu Mawatha, Off Nugegoda Road, Thalawathugoda to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaiddispute to him for settlement by arbitration.\n\nRAVINDRA SAMARAWEERA,Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nColombo,24th July, 2019.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/02/2018/152.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\n1. Mr. M.A. Saman Wenura Nishantha, No. 409/8 A, Kottunna Road, Janamahima Place, Biyagama.\n\n2. Mr. P.P.D.N. Karunarathna, No. 458/1, -C, Mankada Road, Lower Biyanwila, Kadawatha. of the one part\n\nand\n\nCeylon Petroleum Storage Terminals Limited, Nimawa, Kolonnawa of the other part.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013\n\n\u201cWhether Mr. M. A. Saman Wenura Nishantha and Mr. P.P.D.N.Karunarathna working at the Ceylon Petroleum Storage Terminals Limitedhave been caused injustice by the adaptation of a new marking scheme at the interview held for internal promotions to grade A-7, 2017 andIf so, to what relief they are entitled:\n\nA. WIMALAWEERA,Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Office of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo this 08th day of July, 2019.\n\n08 - 732\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/02/2018/192.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)"
