    "chunk_text": "wxl 2136$11 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 13 jeks w`.yrejdod - 2019'08'13No. 2136/11 \u2013 TUESDAY, AUGUST 13, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) - GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - PG 30725 - 32 (2019/08)\n\nESALA FESTIVAL OF MAHIYANGANA 2019\n\nBY virtue or the powers vested in me by the Transfer of Powers (Divisional Secretaries)Act No.58 of 1992,and accordingto the regulations in terms of the provisions of the Pilgrimages Ordinance (chapter 362)publish in Government GazetteNo.9902 of 10th September 1948,Gazette No.10283 of 17th August 1951 Gazette No.14778 of 25lh March 1995 and GazetteNo.14752 of 09th June 1967, I, Dissanayaka Mudiyanselage Nimal Dissanayaka the Divisional Secretaries of Mahiyangana,do hereby inform the following orders shall be in force with regard to the camp of Mahiyangana Esala Festival 2019.\n\n1.It is announced, the Mahiyangana Esala Festival will be commenced on the 30th August 2019 in the closure of theevent will be followed by the \u201cDiya Kepeema\u201d ceremony on the 14th September 2019.\n\n2.The camp are for abode of pilgrims shall be the land demarcated by the 37th Mile post of Mahiyangana-Bibilamain road up to the 1/39 culvert in front of Mahiyangana National School,and the land situated between theMahiyangana-Meegahakiula road the leading to the clock tower in front of Mahiyangana hospital and new highway.\n\n3.No person shall cook meals in \u201cVihara Maluwa\u2019,'Dewala Boomiya\u201d, \u201cPalle Veediya\u201d (The court yards of the Vihara,Bodiand Dewala or within those premises."
  },
