    "chunk_text": "I do hereby grant Permission to the Chief Secretary and the Accounting Officers of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council todisburse as per the first supplementary financial statement for the year 2019, by viture of powers vested in me under Section27 (a) of the Provincial Council Act, No. 42 of 1987, as the term of the 06th Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka ended on 26th September, 2017.\n\nThis permission will be valid till 31st of December, 2019 or upto the date that expires 03 months from the date of summoningthe 07th Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council or from the date re-start the functions of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Councilwhich occurs first.\n\nDHAMMA DISSANAYAKE,Honourable Governor,Sabaragamuwa Province.\n\n19th July, 2019.\n\nAuthorization\n\nI do hereby grant Permission to the Chief Secretary and the Accounting Officers of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council tobear the expenses stated in the Second Schedule, which is estimated for theAdvance Account Activities of the SabaragamuwaProvincial Council for the period that starts on 01st of January, 2019 and end On 31st of December 2019, by viture of powersvested in me under Section 27 (a) of the Provincial Council Act, No. 42 of 1987, as the term of the 06th SabaragamuwaProvincial Council of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka ended on 26th September, 2017.\n\nAccordingly, I do hereby grant permission to the Chief Secretary and the Accounting Officers of the SabaragamuwaProvincial Council to bear the expenses Subject to those limits.\n\nThis Permission will be valid till 31st of December, 2019.\n\nDHAMMA DISSANAYAKE,Honourable Governor,Sabaragamuwa Province.\n\n19th July , 2019.\n\n08 - 1034\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
