    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2136/25 - 2019 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8i 16 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0286\u00fd\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.08.16\n\nNo. 2136/25 \u2013 FRIDAY, AUGUST, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nRef No.: \u0db8\u0dc4/3/324/\u0d85\u01ae.\n\nI, hereby give notice under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7\n\nof the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land\n\nAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the\n\nGovernment intends to acquire the following lands which\n\nare required for the public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:- The allotments of lands shown below in Preliminary\n\nPlan No. 9745, prepared by the Surveyor General,\n\ncontaining in extenth of 0.0022 Hectare situated in the\n\nvillage of Kottawa in the Divisional Secretary's Division\n\nof Maharagama, in the District of Colombo, in the\n\nWestern Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 1 Name of the land: \u2014; Land use: High-level Road; Claimant of the Land: State, Part of Lot No. 1 in Preliminary Plan No. Co. 9635; Extent: 0.0003 Hectare.\n\n2. Lot No. 2 Name of the land: \u2014; Land use: High-level Road; Claimant of the Land: State, Part of Lot No. 1 in Preliminary Plan No. Co. 9635. Claimed by Mr. M. L. William, No. 73, Wekanda Road, Colombo 02; Extent: 0.0004 Hectare.\n\n3. Lot No. 3 Name of the land: \u2014; Land use: High-level Road; Claimant of the Land: State, Part of Lot No. 1 in Preliminary Plan No. Co. 9635. Claimed by Mr. M. P. William, No. 1420/10/1A, Nedunawatta, Ganemulla; Extent: 0.0010 Hectare.\n\n4. Lot No. 4 Name of the land: \u2014; Land use: High-level Road; Claimant of the Land: State, Part of Lot No. 1 in Preliminary Plan No. Co. 9635. Claimed by Mr. M. E. D. William, No. 3, Thotewatta Mawatha, Wewala, Ja-Ela; Extent: 0.0005 Hectare.\n\nG 30738 - 27 (2019/08) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices"
