    "chunk_text": "(iii) Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above during six (06) years immediatelypreceding the date of promotion in accordance with the approved procedure or performance appraisal.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A G 30741 \u2014 22 (08/2019)\n\n13.2 (a)\n\n(ii) Should have completed at least six (06) years of active and satisfactory period of service in Grade II of thecategory of service and earned six (06) salary increments.\n\n(iv) Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above during six (06) years immediately precedingthe date of promotion in accordance with the approved procedure of performance appraisal.\n\nThe following note will be included below the qualifications referred to under 13.2 (a).\n\nNote\n\nThe officers who are to be promoted to Grade II and have completed the qualifications referred to in the amended 13.1.1(a) asat 26th of February 2019, the date on which the Cabinet of Ministers made the policy decision and the officers who werepromoted to Grade II prior to such date will be promoted to Grade I from the date they complete a period of 12 years of activeand satisfactory service in Grade III and II and all other qualifications referred to under 13.2(a) excluding the qualification in13.2(a) (ii).\n\n09- 07\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
