    "chunk_text": "Mr. A. M. Nishanthapriya,No. 204/29/08,Rathnagiri Watta,Hirana,Panadura.\n\nOf One Part\n\nCase No. A/50/2019and\n\nCeylon Fishery Harbour Corporation,No. 15, Rockhouse LaneColombo 15.\n\nOf Other Part\n\nTHE AWARD\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties are :-\n\nWhether the cancellation of salary revision given to Mr. A. M. Nishanthapriya, Supra Grade Clerk of the CeylonFishery Harbours Corporation on two occasions with effect from 01.08.2014 and 01.01.2016 is just and if not so, to what reliefhe is entitled.\n\nAppearance\n\nMr. Gratian Silva, Representative appeared for the party of the First Part.\n\nMr.D. M. S. K. Wijetunga, Assistant Human Resources Manager appeared for the Party of the Second Part.\n\nParty of the First Part filled the 1st statement under regulations 21(1) and 21(2) of the Industrial Disputes Regulationsof 1958 as amended.\n\nOn behalf of Party of the Second Part Mr. D. M. S. K. Wijetunga Assistant Human Resources Manager informed the Courtsalary revision was already granted to the Party of the First part. Futher the Party of the First Part also informed the Court thathe was granted the relief he sought for. Therefore the matter was settled. in the circumstances I make no award.\n\nKAPILA M. SARATHCHANDRA,Arbitrator.22nd July, 2019\n\n09 - 17\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA"
